Your task is to extract [subject, predicate, object] triples from the given passage and the provided named entity list, to construct an RDF graph.
Respond with a JSON object only, in the format {"triples": [["subject", "predicate", "object"], ...]}.

Requirements:
- Each triple should contain at least one, but preferably two, of the named entities in the given list.
- Clearly resolve pronouns (he/she/it/they etc.) to their specific names to maintain clarity.
- Use concise natural-language phrases for predicates (e.g. "located in", "founded on", "part of").
- Only state facts explicitly expressed in the passage; do not invent anything.
- Do not output anything other than the JSON object.

Paragraph:
```
{passage}
```

Named entity list:
{named_entity_json}
